Z||000000||Gerald||11-03-2001||02:53 AM||||Racing is fun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Getting cought is not  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I was racing a VW Corrardo. It looked to be in very good shape. I took him off the line all the way up to 80kph. <P>Anyway Im slowing down as im finished racing for the night andthe light ahead is turning red. Thats when I saw thoses perty little flashing lights. Maybe hes going somwhere else. This is wrong as they was just going wide around us so that they could block both our cars. I got a ticket for 172 cdn and im not sure how many demerits. But any is too many. Im going to go to coart and try to get the ticket lowered. Is this likly?<P> Any how I bet we could turn this into a worst ticket tread. Wouldnt that be fun.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>87 coupe 5 spd||||reg||9
