Z||000002||84fierotrevor||11-03-2001||03:41 PM||||If u guys wanna stope getting speeding ticktes there is this thing called pre paid legal serivce i just recently got myself<BR>its only 26.99 a month and i thought it was the stupids thing i had ever seen !<BR>But anyways I used to work at chevron gravyard tell about 4 weeks ago i quit but all those ricers meet there every friday and saturday night before they go to the races and after the cops swarm in and reck there fun and so since i worked grave yard weekends they all became regular costomers<BR>and every single person i had talked to had told me about this thing called prepaid legal services which they all have and when they get pulled over by police and the officer asks you know why i pulled u over ?  they hand the officer this card that says my legal rights are protected and and a cell phone and say nope but talk to my lawyer about it and this lawer guy u get is there 24-7 for u for any trouble u get into, and supposible this has gotten then all outa speeding ticktes cuss they swear by it, wether this is true or not ? i don't know yet. but im gonna find out when i get my car.  also my manager at chevron used the guy to lower his alomoni for child support in court cuss he called the lawer up and he came in and apperd in court for him.<BR>i honestly dont know if this thing works for speeding ticktets, but i have a success story from it sorta,<BR>I just had my wisdom teeth pulled last monday and are careprovider wouldnt pay for more then two of my wisdom teeth to be pulled and my mom tried to fight it and failed and we talked to the oral sergin he said that are piticular provider never ever pays for more then two teeth, well i called up my laywer number on my card explained it to him, he asked me a few questions, called back the next day and said we have the go ahead for all for teeth and wouldn't have to pay the extra 475 bucks to have the other two teeth pulled. So it was worth the 26.99 dollers i paid for it for the first month and i think i am gonna renew it next month too.<P>------------------<BR>84 fiero 2m4 <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar_6.jpg"> ||||reg||1
