Z||000008||Gerald||11-05-2001||06:13 AM||||IF I get 6 I think I lose my licence. Thatis not cool at all. The cop told me to take it to court and try to get it reduced. He said if I need to I could get ahold of him so I think hes working with me. He was a nice cop. Is that rare? He didnt clock us and I didnt try to get the guy to race me. I was just speeding at about 20 kph over limit and he tried to race me. I dont think I went much over 100 in a 70 zone. Like I said befor the cop has no clue how fast I was really going. I dont think that its fair that I get 6 demerits when I other wise would of only of gotten 3 if the other guy didnt try to catch me.||||reg||1
